-col gap-3.5 nav:mt-4","children":[["$","p","Deiparine Community Hospital opened in 1974 as a small lying-in clinic along the national highway in Poblacion, Sibonga. Families who once travelled two hours to Cebu City for a delivery or an appendectomy could finally be treated in their own town.",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-700 nav:text-base","children":"Deiparine Community Hospital opened in 1974 as a small lying-in clinic along the national highway in Poblacion, Sibonga. Families who once travelled two hours to Cebu City for a delivery or an appendectomy could finally be treated in their own town."}],["$","p","Five decades later the hospital is DOH-licensed and PhilHealth-accredited, with a 24-hour emergency room, two operating rooms, a delivery suite, and a diagnostic complex that includes digital X-ray, ultrasound, and a 16-slice CT scanner.",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-700 nav:text-base","children":"Five decades later the hospital is DOH-licensed and PhilHealth-accredited, with a 24-hour emergency room, two operating rooms, a delivery suite, and a diagnostic complex that includes digital X-ray, ultrasound, and a 16-slice CT scanner."}],["$","p","Ownership and leadership remain with the Deiparine family, and the majority of the 120-person care team was hired from Sibonga and the neighbouring municipalities of Argao, Dumanjug, and Barili.",{"className":"text-[15px] leading-[1.7] text-ink-700 nav:text-base","children":"Ownership and leadership remain with the Deiparine family, and the majority of the 120-person care team was hired from Sibonga and the neighbouring municipalities of Argao, Dumanjug, and Barili."}]]}]]}],"$Le"]}],"$Lf","$L10"],null,"$L11"]}],"p":"$@12","v":"$13","s":"$9"}}]]
